WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.316 --> 00:00:11.302
Today’s task: cover a whole using only halves and quarters.

2
00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:13.977
Tap a piece in the palette. It goes into the circle.

3
00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:17.048
Pieces fit edge to edge, clockwise from the top.

4
00:00:17.048 --> 00:00:20.077
A full circle says 1 whole: 1/2 + 1/4 + 1/4 = 1.

5
00:00:20.077 --> 00:00:24.423
A full circle takes no more, so the next piece starts a new circle.

6
00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:27.693
Compare them side by side: two ways to make one whole.

7
00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:31.777
Tap a piece to select it, then Delete takes it away.

8
00:00:31.777 --> 00:00:34.906
Drag a piece onto another circle to move it there.

9
00:00:34.906 --> 00:00:40.194
Labels can show fractions, percents or decimals.

10
00:00:40.194 --> 00:00:45.700
Rings view puts every size in one circle to compare.
